    q("mcq-101","mcq","Markovnikov's rule: in HX addition to unsymmetric alkene, H adds to?",["More substituted C","Less substituted C","Both equally","Carbon with lone pair"],"Less substituted C","H goes to C with more H already (Markovnikov).","hard","organic"),
