      "Both true, R explains A","Higher pressure → more gas dissolves.","medium","solutions"),
    q("ar-16","assertion_reason","A: Diamond is an electrical insulator.\nR: All electrons in diamond are in covalent bonds.",
      ["Both true, R explains A","Both true, R doesn't explain A","A true R false","A false R true"],
      "Both true, R explains A","No free electrons in diamond lattice.","medium","bonding"),
